# PostHog project key for teslam.io — AgentBase org, US Cloud. This is the
# public write-only key (phc_); the secret phx_ key never belongs in an env
# file that reaches a browser bundle. Inlined at build time, so changing it on
# Vercel takes a redeploy, not a restart. Absent, analytics is a no-op and the
# site builds and runs clean.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=
